{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：发现Linux属主或用户。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：System Owner/User Discovery Linux。","from":"now-119m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*","endgame-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"interval":"60m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：发现Linux属主或用户","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"bf8c007c-7dee-4842-8e9a-ee534c09d205","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:linux and event.type:start and event.action:(exec or exec_event or start) and\nprocess.name:(\"whoami\" or \"w\" or \"who\" or \"users\" or \"id\" or \"groups\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1033","name":"System Owner/User Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1033/"},{"id":"T1069","name":"Permission Groups Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["process.parent.executable","process.command_line","host.id"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：发现Linux属主或用户\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清账号、网络、主机或云资源\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":9,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
